---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white">数字<span class="text-gradient">花园</span></p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
          种下想法，耐心浇灌，<br />等待文字与光影慢慢生长。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-300">导航</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-500">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300">博客</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gallery" class="transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300">影像</a></li>
          <li><a href="/life" class="transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300">记录</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guestbook" class="transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300">留言板</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-300">找到我</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-500">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/zhouxiaolangxiansen" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300">GitHub</a></li>
          <li>
            <button
              id="copy-email"
              data-email="hcz.email@qq.com"
              class="cursor-pointer text-sm text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300"
              aria-label="复制邮箱地址"
              title="点击复制邮箱地址"
            >
              <span id="copy-email-text">Email</span>
            </button>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-6 text-xs text-zinc-600 md:flex-row">
      <p>© {year} 周大牛 · 用热爱构建</p>
      <a href="#top" class="transition-colors hover:text-zinc-300">回到顶部 ↑</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('copy-email');
  btn?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const textEl = document.getElementById('copy-email-text');
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(btn.dataset.email ?? '');
      if (textEl) {
        textEl.textContent = '已复制 ✓';
        setTimeout(() => (textEl.textContent = 'Email'), 2000);
      }
    } catch {
      if (textEl) textEl.textContent = '复制失败';
    }
  });
</script>
